        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/1cc13e2a38fa224aa1607c504b084a68.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>SQUARE PILL ESCAPE!! (the 4 Keys)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a 3D and 2D platform/puzzle game with physics-based movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control a simple square pill, hunt for crystals, discover new partners to help you solve puzzles and face your opponents, drive construction vehicles, light your way in the dark, unlock new areas, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge, precision, thinking, cooperation, exploration, action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/8de9f84975464ff3e972cd6fc71c1566.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>!! Warning : Don't be fooled by appearances !!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No guns, no blood, but a little pill that's tricky to handle and will require some serious training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A tough challenge that won't be for everyone, but will reward the most determined players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After the first few tutorial levels, the adventure will become more intense, taking a less conceptual and increasingly exploratory turn with increasingly vast levels and varied atmospheres, bringing new game mechanics each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Graphically, the game is peppered with tributes to American architect Frank Lloyd Wright (patterns, furniture).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A code system for each level allows you to replay them at will (for practice or for fun), even if you have restarted a new game and erased your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you find the 4 keys? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ready for a timed challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Head to the Art Gallery for your rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/a1096c27d6b533789533dbe3083c90a6.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/5f6fc9a350a76e7489d55042d839ebc0.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/5739ba7c060d5bac60c024b879d104f1.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/1cc13e2a38fa224aa1607c504b084a68.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>SQUARE PILL ESCAPE!! (the 4 Keys)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a 3D and 2D platform/puzzle game with physics-based movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control a simple square pill, hunt for crystals, discover new partners to help you solve puzzles and face your opponents, drive construction vehicles, light your way in the dark, unlock new areas, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge, precision, thinking, cooperation, exploration, action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/8de9f84975464ff3e972cd6fc71c1566.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>!! Warning : Don't be fooled by appearances !!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No guns, no blood, but a little pill that's tricky to handle and will require some serious training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A tough challenge that won't be for everyone, but will reward the most determined players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After the first few tutorial levels, the adventure will become more intense, taking a less conceptual and increasingly exploratory turn with increasingly vast levels and varied atmospheres, bringing new game mechanics each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Graphically, the game is peppered with tributes to American architect Frank Lloyd Wright (patterns, furniture).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A code system for each level allows you to replay them at will (for practice or for fun), even if you have restarted a new game and erased your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you find the 4 keys? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ready for a timed challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Head to the Art Gallery for your rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/a1096c27d6b533789533dbe3083c90a6.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/5f6fc9a350a76e7489d55042d839ebc0.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053490/extras/5739ba7c060d5bac60c024b879d104f1.avif?t=1765792597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
